{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/Landscape_Shot_GIF_04.gif?t=1743590213\" />Play from the top-down inspired camera, experience the linear story  and  puzzle elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i> </i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore Mysterious Levels:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure through uniquely designed levels.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve Puzzles:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve <i>challenging puzzles</i> to progress.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hunt Monsters:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle <i>dangerous monsters</i> and defeat them with <strong><i>fast paced</i></strong> combat mechanics.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join Our Story:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a part of the unfolding story and immerse yourself in the adventure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover New Mechanics:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore innovative gameplay mechanics and become stronger.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hunt with Special Skill:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your gun\u2019s special skill to eliminate enemies with limited bullets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress with Your Katana:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield your katana to fight enemies and continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <i>Be a raccoon master.</i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/Character_Shot_GIF_02.gif?t=1743590213\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.aka